   "q": "What does petrichor mean?",
   "a": "The smell of rain on dry ground! The word comes from Greek, meaning stone."
  },
  {
   "q": "What does ubiquitous mean?",
   "a": "Found everywhere! Like phones in a restaurant."
  },
  {
   "q": "What does ephemeral mean?",
   "a": "Lasting a very short time! Like a soap bubble."
  },
  {
   "q": "What does defenestration mean?",
   "a": "Throwing someone out of a window! Yes, there's a word for that. Prague is famous for it."
  },
  {
   "q": "What does serendipity mean?",
   "a": "A lucky discovery by accident! Penicillin was found that way."
  },
  {
